# Transcribed from Vamsi's VS Code REST Client file (lines 1-29). Password masked on purpose.
@loginUrl = https://dm1-us.informaticacloud.com
@baseURL = https://usw1-mdm.dm1-us.informaticacloud.com
@username = VVamsi-IDMCDev
@password = <your IDMC password - set locally, never commit>

### Step 1: Authenticate to get IDS-SESSION-ID
# @name login
POST {{loginUrl}}/saas/public/core/v3/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Capture Session ID from response
@sessionId = {{login.response.body.$.userInfo.sessionId}}
@PodMDMUserSessionId = {{login.response.body.$.userInfo.sessionId}}

@publicURL = https://usw1-mdm.dm1-us.informaticacloud.com
### Search / Search & Filter Business Entity
# NOTE: original line 23 was https://{{publicURL}}/... which doubles the scheme (https://https://...). Fixed below.
POST {{publicURL}}/search/public/api/v1/search
IDS-SESSION-ID: {{PodMDMUserSessionId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entityType": "c360.organization",
  "pageSize": 5
  # ...rest cut off in photo
}
